      "text": "Abraham dwells at residence of father, Abr. 1:1. Abraham’s father is led away by Egyptians’ idolatry, Abr. 1:27. is sorely tormented because of famine, Abr. 1:30. yet lives in Ur, Abr. 2:1. follows Abraham into land of Haran, Abr. 2:4. continues in Haran, returns to idolatry, Abr. 2:5.",
